{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30242","headline":"重送徐州李从事商隠 · 薛逢","name":"重送徐州李从事商隠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓乘征骑带犀渠，醉别都门惨袂初。\n莲府望高秦御史，柳营官重汉尚书。\n斩蛇泽畔人烟晓，戏马台前树影疎。\n尺组挂身何用处，古来名利尽丘墟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}